==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tanjiro Kamado CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Tanjiro Kamado is an [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]]/[[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Angel]] super-backline sniper with many advantages. While his general DPS appears to be on the lower side, he makes up for it through excellent effective range and versatility via [[Long Distance]] coverage as well as [[Explosion]]s. His high pierce allows him to put pressure far beyond the front lines at a completely safe distance.

Against target traits, his sword is as deadly as the demons he slays, reaching upwards of ~16,000 DPS on average at Lv.30 (~25,400 DPS at Lv.50). His attack rate is relatively quick too, which means enemies will find it difficult to consistently enter his blind spot as long as you defend him well. However, it is worth noting that his inside range is painfully small when compared to his piercing range, identical to that of [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]]. This makes him difficult to use against tanky or otherwise speedy enemies that can barge their way into his blind spot in between attack cycles. This can include [[Brollow]]s, [[Teacher Bun Bun]] variants, [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] and [[Winged Pigge]] among others. Even with this, he is guaranteed at least one reposition through [[Survive]] in the event that a fiend under Muzan makes an attempt on his head.

Overall, a fine Uber with many great matchups against high range pests like [[Cala Maria]]/[[Calamary]], [[Lowkey]], or [[Gobble]], while being an alright generalist super-backline option for many stages. His immunities even make him decent for Surge-heavy stages, including against [[St. Dober]] if you can manage to hold him in place!

{{Job|Classification = Super-Backliner & Nuker}}

